#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.rst:2
msgid "TrackAnalysis"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.TrackAnalysis:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres des analyses des trajectoires."
msgstr "Class containing track analysis settings:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.TrackAnalysis:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.TrackAnalysis:5
msgid "``MSD`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : calcule le déplacement quadratique moyen."
msgstr "``MSD`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`): computes the mean squared displacement."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.TrackAnalysis:6
msgid "``Instant Diffusion`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : calcule la diffusion instantanée."
msgstr "``Instant Diffusion`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`): computes instantaneous diffusion."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.TrackAnalysis:7
msgid "``Fit Length`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : longueur initiale de la fenêtre d'ajustement ; valeur par défaut : ``4``."
msgstr "``Fit Length`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`): initial fitting-window length; default value: ``4``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.TrackAnalysis:8
msgid "``Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : modèle de mouvement utilisé pour l'ajustement."
msgstr "``Fit`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`): motion model used for fitting."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TrackAnalysis.TrackAnalysis:9
msgid "``3D`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : prend en compte la coordonnée Z."
msgstr "``3D`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`): includes the Z coordinate."

